      "id": "emudhra-2026-10",
      "title": "eMudhra intermediate compromise (October 2026)",
      "summary": "Eight eMudhra intermediates were cross-signed by Sectigo with trivially weak P-384 private keys. Roots involved: emSign ECC Root CA - G3 and AAA Certificate Services. The hosts are the DV, OV, and EV G3B and G3C test endpoints, once for each root path.",
      "notes": [
        "On macOS, Security.framework soft-fails open when the G3B OCSP responder returns 503. An nscurl result of exposed can be that soft-fail. A blocked result is a trust failure. A timeout is unknown. It does not mean the tool rejected the chain."
      ],
      "endpoints": [
        { "host": "dv-g3b-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" },
        { "host": "dv-g3c-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" },
        { "host": "ov-g3b-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" },
        { "host": "ov-g3c-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" },
        { "host": "ev-g3b-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" },
        { "host": "ev-g3c-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" },
        { "host": "dv-g3b-aaa-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "AAA Certificate Services" },
        { "host": "dv-g3c-aaa-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "AAA Certificate Services" },
        { "host": "ov-g3b-aaa-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "AAA Certificate Services" },
        { "host": "ov-g3c-aaa-emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com", "root": "AAA Certificate Services" },
